      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely stays professional. \n\ni just ran it through the internal tool and the density score is actually pretty low (it only caught the words 'growth', 'portfolio', and 'diversification' once or twice). for the premium tier of the newsletter, the system usually flags anything under a certain threshold, and i don't want it getting stuck in the draft queue.\n\ncan you do a second pass? try to weave those themes—growth, yield, diversification, and portfolio—in a bit more naturally throughout the text so the score is higher, but please keep it actually readable. i really don't want a wall of buzzwords, it just needs more substance around those specific topics.",
